# SIFU Interview Coach — real AI answer evaluation (optional).
# Without this key, SIFU still works: it falls back to a simulated evaluation.
# To enable real Claude-powered feedback:
#   • Local: copy this file to .env.local and paste your key below, then restart the dev server.
#   • Vercel: add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in Project Settings → Environment Variables.
# The key is read server-side only (in app/api/interview-feedback/route.ts) and never exposed to the browser.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
